Review diffs, callers and tests. Probe unresolved findings when permitted. After denial, source only. Read edit targets first using required read tools. Bugs require a failing regression before source edits, then the full suite. Scoped extractions with known caller policies use this rule. Search checkout for unknowns. Cover gaps, baseline once, preserve policies, retest, review diff. Batch independent calls. Use documented commands. Prevent test byproducts. Diagnose setup before retrying. Reuse passing checks while inputs and environment match. Load `compound` for broader refactors, features, performance and PR authoring. Follow project and user instructions. Report checks and limits. Omit AI commit attribution.
